          "ocr_text": "S- Paul an apostle of Jesus Christ by the will of God to the saints who are in ephesus, and faithful in Christ Jesus. Grace to you and peace from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ. Eph 1:1,2\n\nO - He identifies who he is, the authority by which he comes, his mission and who his audience is and what his message is.\n\n1. Man - Paul / Man - Paul / And Christ / Messenger - Jongeun / Mandate - Authority - Under God\n2. Mandate/Mission / Mandate - Authority - Under God / Message -\n3. Market / Market - Audience - Saints \u0026 Faithful / Message - Grace \u0026 Peace\n4. Message\n\nA - I'll do all my intros with this format.\nMessenger - Jongeun\nMissing - Help Ramos guys to succeed in life\nMandate - God's Word\nMarket - Ramos quarters\nMessage - Steward your time/talent/treasure well\n\nP - God please help me to be a blessing tonight\n\nIntro - Jongeun Pastor - 3rd generation local. Make a teachers salary. Never made more than a teachers salary. Grandparents - Restaurant owners, real estate, Gas stations, Auto Parts \u0026 stock market. Dad Islani aged → Full time ministry.\n• Desire for ministry - marketplace. Dad - Bivocational Rule of 72%. Not keep much you make but what you do with what you make. Remy doubled or is more than a million dollars. 2 million",
