          "ocr_text": "Steps to Big Picture\n(1) Micro → Macro\n    Detailed observation - Be Do this 2x! per sermon. Only 1500 words, be with others.\n(2) Catalyst \u0026 (Community) = Discipline\n    Catalyst makes faster \u0026 lengthens RW!\n(3) The preaching life: Preaching makes me a better person.\n\nArcheology produces Artistry.\nStudy each book in detailed observation.\n3x detailed observation, 1x circle, 2x underline, 3x strike through.\n\nCOMMUNITY = DISCIPLINE\n\nPut Detailed Observation in the meeting.\n  Micro → Macro\n  Catalyst → Community\n\nThings to Observe\n• Subject, Object, verb\n• Propositions\n• Conjunctions\n\nTone of Scripture → Translate → Tone of life\nEx Example. Gal - you abolish Galations who has bewitched. You Foolish → Tone of Father → stupid kids.\nIllustration → I did this dumb. My father scolded me.\n\nThemes- Neh 4 - Sanballat - Opposition, mockery\n\nIntroduction- Disclose/Withheld- They mocked- We built",
