          "journal_date": "2025-02-23",
          "ocr_text": "S- And with all unrighteousness deception among those who perish because they did not (receive) the love of the truth, that they might be saved. II Thess 1:10\n\nO- Don't even need to reject truth, we just used to not LOVE TRUTH. We need to RECEIVE the LOVE TRUTH.\n\nA- I need to (receive) a LOVE of TRUTH. David loved the WORD because he read it. As we read it, we begin to love it.\n\nP- God, help me to sponge on your word to love your word.",
