          "journal_date": "2025-03-06",
          "ocr_text": "Love God through loving his word.\n\nBible isn't work. It's our love.\nWhat will be MY call from the LORD? \"I stand before God, for you.\"\n\nThe scriptures are a place to sit and hear. Not just a tool to use.\n\nPain Points\n• Series \u0026 Sermon Planning.\n• Prepping 3 weeks in advance\n• Hard to form habits.\n  Heredity vs Artistry\n\nTeaching Team FORMATION\nNeed community for formation",
