          "import_seq": 1001,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "S-L 3\n\nJam 3 - deals w prophecy b4 given - people who think they're \"used\" (not prophets). The body of the prophets of God - there is no true prophecy. Only fake people or no one.\n\nP- People need w/ knowledge of what God's word is - before then Can they preach? Can they even know if they're preaching God's word?\n\nA - So look at myself - am I reading + understanding God's word enough? All of it? to see what to do All the time - can I even know if I'm following God's word?\n\nP - God - help me - use his word - all of what he said - \u0026 even enough - to know what to do\n\nO - So based in what I read + I can experience \u0026 restore to see\n\nAll - example so we're just \"eating\" (as examples so eating whole - a whole Bible - for sure]\n\n...\u0026 the dead \u0026 eternity. I considered it in the light of God's Word \u0026 eternity. For God has said \u0026 the Book of Life. I the dead, all judged according to their deeds. Remember Psalm 90:12 \"So teach us to number our days, that we may gain a heart of wisdom.\" \u0026 Eccl 12:13-14 \"Fear God and keep His commandments for this is the whole duty of man. For God will bring every work into judgment, including every hidden thing, whether good or evil.\" All these things are testing us. Are we storing up our treasures in heaven or on earth? Matt 6:19-21 \"Do not store up for yourselves treasures on earth, where moths and vermin destroy, and where thieves break in and steal. But store up for yourselves treasures in heaven...For where your treasure is, there your heart will be also.\"",
          "person_id": "2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd",
          "photo_url": "https://yddjlhdptsundeimugba.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/soap-photos/2aa35958-9057-44bd-aaf2-bd12a4cf9ecd/1783212250688.jpeg",
