          "import_seq": 2002,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-06",
          "ocr_text": "God is light \u0026 in Him is no darkness at all. If we say that we have fellowship with Him \u0026 walk in darkness, we lie \u0026 do not practice the truth. But if we walk in the light as He is in the light, we have fellowship with one another \u0026 the blood of Jesus Christ His Son cleanses us from all sin. If we say that we have no sin, we deceive ourselves \u0026 the truth is not in us. If we confess our sins, He is faithful \u0026 just to forgive us our sins \u0026 to cleanse us from all unrighteousness. If we say that we have not sinned, we make Him a liar \u0026 His word is not in us.",
