          "ocr_text": "S - All unrighteousness is sin and there is sin not leading to death. 1 John 5:17\nO - All sin is not the same. There's sin that leads to death. What is that sin? It is sin against the Holy Spirit? Sin against the body? Sexual sin? Sin against the Holy Spirit?\nA - I should look at other sin in the Bible. Some sins can lead to death But why not pray about those things?\nP - God please help me to repent and give attention to my heart and to give you all of my heart.",
