          "ocr_text": "Set your affection on things above not on things of this earth.\n\nO- I can SET my affection on the right things. I don't need to be led by my flesh and desires of my self.\n\nA- I need to SET my affection. INVITE my heart in the right things.\n\nP- God help me to put rails. Fences around my heart and life to do the right thing.\n\nTaylor Daniel Stevens - EN Updates\nRomans 15:2 Many names recognized prioritize relationships.\nClusters are an investment\n1. Reconnect Relationally\n2. ReCredi our Faith\n3. ReFocus on Mission\n• vision leaks\n\nOvercall         7membership Standards?\nPastor\nApostolic   Global Team\nCouncil\n                Regiona\n\nPhil Baroco -\nGerry said yes and God placed His heart for BBC into his heart.\nSo many say no and give their hearts to other things.\nGod is asking who will go? His eyes roam looking for someone\nto show strong on His behalf. I need to say yes globally\nvs Gerry said locally.\n\nSeth Trimmer - Finishing Strong\nIs it happens to them, when to me?\nGive up vs Try harder = End is near.\nSomething broken, Jesus can fix it.\nDiscipline enforces the heart. Good or Bad\nMatt 19:14 Parable of treasure. Whoy to sell everything.\nKingdom is worth EVERYTHING. Desire/Attraction/Love.\nWhat you love, you will sacrifice EVERYTHING for, and not cia\n\nSell everything for Jesus vs Sell Jesus for everything.\nJesus and Mary vs Jesus and Judas\nJesus IS the Reward. Doing things 4 Jesus vs dwelling",
