          "ocr_text": "Pastor Billy Lile - Spiritual Family - mich, nadson, Arkenna\nSpiritual Family heals natural family - Unless a man leaves they cannot be my disciple,\nEph 2:19-22 - No longer strangers, but citizens \u0026 members of his household.\n\nCitizens AND family\n\nSpiritual Family - God's design for his people.\n* club \u0026 change/conflict\n* friend \u0026 change \u0026 choose\n* natural family \u0026 purpose\n\nNeed to be intentional all relationships.\n1. Cultivate Relationships (Daily Care) eg. Water, Earth giving, create Fun in storm\n2. Cheer/Celebrate one another\n3. Pray w/ one another - Prayer - Passionate\nSpiritual Family fuels healthy \u0026 sustain ministry\n\nBeloved, I pray that you may prosper in all things and be in health, just as your soul prospers.\n\nO- God's desire is that our soul (mind will emotions) are in health, and that we also prosper in all things.\n\nA- Prosperity is nothing if my soul is not prospering. I need to prioritize the health of my soul.\n\nP- God please help my soul to prosper. Help me to prioritize prosperity and love myself the way you love me.",
