          "import_seq": 79001,
          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "Kingdom is treasure in the field to sell everything for\nto extract value from.\n• Bernard of Clairvaaux 4 stages\n1. Love self for self. Liteness to feel good about yourself\n2. Love God for self. Use God for me.\n3. Love God for God - Unconditional love of God\n4. Love self for Gods Sake - Loving everything and everyone with\nthe same love that God has, including ourselves.\nThis is NOT SELF Esteem and Self love.\n\nStaying in the game is growing in Gods LOVE.\n\nSymptoms of NOT Growing\nPetition vs Adoration\nJoyful disappointment vs Devastated (Endeans indicate things\nFatigue vs Burnout                     that are NOT in its place)\nLarry Crabb\n\nWhen I am in pain, \"How do I find God here?\"\nBeginning Test: Test of Self Centeredness\nFinish Test: Test of Justified Self centeredness.",
