          "ocr_text": "Hagar - Avon\nYou need to be active in the treasury.\nYour need to know what options -\nowe $30,000, you have options of what you pay.\nComplex individuals?\n\nIntentional \u0026 Engaging -\nGoals: Where do you want to be?\n  What are you willing to do?\n  Faithful \u0026 Consistent = Success.\n  Difference b/t success and failure is consistent.\n  Do what your passionate about\n  Passion = Consistence and Persistent\n  3ys of Surviving, no one can compete",
