          "ocr_text": "Sidney\n\nFear - All\nFailure - All\nFaith - Some\nSuccess - Less\n\nHow to Start\n1. Do what you love\n2. Differentiate from competitors\n3. Study - factor - Book keeping\n4. Get Mentor \u0026 Read books\n\nDavid Ward Thoughts:\n1. Fathers Eyes\n2. No condemnation\n3. Love keeps no record of wrang\n4. God is love\n5. Matt 6 - What you haven't done he wont remember. What you have done he wont forget\n6. What you attach neg emotion you'll avoid.\n\nPest Hole of Community with work in between.\n\nIllustrations\nWord Picture - crushed olives\nUse elsewhere -\nRe-enact metaphor - so they can feel it\nReserved metaphor - use that metaphore in modern days.\nForce metaphore\nVinettes - Pieces of a story - Theylight not - 3 stories woven together - lift many stages of life\nParables - Recognize stories in life.\nOthers Story\nScenes - Moves\nQuotes\n\nHonor your Father\nWeight of Glory - Meaning a Feeling\nRespect  Weight\nTo Make Heavy, Honor = Reward  Heavy",
