          "journal_date": "2025-01-01",
          "ocr_text": "S - May He grant you according to your hearts desire, and fulfill all your purpose. Ps 20:4\n\nO - If we delight in the Lord He will give us the desires of our hearts. Then He will grant us according to those desires and fulfill the purpose He has for our lives through them.\n\nA - God has called me to embrace the passions He has placed in my heart and pursue them all. As I stop fighting myself God will give me passion and energy to do everything He has called and purposed for me to do.\n\nP - God thank you for giving me a passion for discipleship and for finance and generosity. Help me PLEASE not to blow up. Amen",
